  <header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">Project · Development project</p><h1>MessMate</h1><p>Hostel and Meal Management Application</p></header>
  <article class="prose">
    <h2>Overview</h2><p>MessMate is a Flask-based application for tracking hostel or mess deposits, meals, meal rates, bazar expenses, and settlement.</p>
    <h2>Problem</h2><p>Shared meal and expense arrangements involve several connected records. MessMate is intended to bring those records together so they can be tracked more clearly.</p>
    <h2>Goals &amp; intended users</h2><p>The project is designed around the needs of people managing or participating in a hostel or mess arrangement. Its goal is to support record-keeping for deposits, meals, expenses, meal rates, and settlement.</p>
    <h2>Verified technology</h2><p>Flask is the verified application framework for this development project. Other implementation details, public hosting, and source-code availability are not presented here because they have not been verified for publication.</p>
    <h2>Current status</h2><p>MessMate is a development project. This portfolio does not claim public deployment, production usage, user adoption, or any performance results.</p>
